Write the full milestone write-up here in Markdown: what was delivered,
key decisions, screenshots (as regular Markdown images), links to the
report, etc. This text renders on the milestone's own page.

To publish this milestone for real:
1. Duplicate this file next to it.
2. Rename it to something like `milestone-1.md` (the file name becomes the page's URL: /milestones/milestone-1).
3. Fill in the fields above and the text below.
4. Delete the `.example` extension is not needed — just make sure the real file ends in `.md`, not `.md.example`.
